repository-code: https://github.com/han023/veremi-audit
url: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22397725
abstract: >-
  A measurement audit of the VeReMi and VeReMi Extension misbehaviour-detection
  benchmarks. One untrained scalar, raw message count, exceeds AUC 0.99 on six of
  the eight Sybil archives. Pseudonyms encode the true sender in 86.5-100% of
  identity pairs, attacker prevalence is fixed at 30% of vehicles, and running one
  detector through seven progressively stricter protocols takes AUC from 0.998 to
  0.843. The package contains the experiments, independent verifiers, result
  tables and the paper source.
keywords:
  - VANET
  - misbehaviour detection
  - Sybil attack
  - benchmarking
  - reproducibility
  - VeReMi
